[{"title":"句","author":"洪希文","text":"佳句不随飞鸟尽，名山可想属僧多。\n沈香已带寅前气，腊酒初闻子后香。\n月明夜色玉连锁，露冷秋茎金屈卮。\n作赋重游前赤壁，题诗一笑再玄都。\n功名不建头颅老，日月如驰髀肉生。\n旧书馀草风搜遍，好树开花月送来。\n凄其死者无归路，羞与雠人共载天。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":31973,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"自题画","author":"陈植","text":"无多茅屋沧波远，一半青山竹树遮。\n宛似吾乡荒寂地，直疑割我白鸥沙。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":31974,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"赠欧阳圭斋 赠欧阳圭斋","author":"孙凤洲","text":"圭斋还是旧圭斋，不带些儿官样回。\n若使他人居二品，门前车马闹如雷。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":31975,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"句","author":"傅子建","text":"鼋鼍沧海赋，龙马赤文书。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":31976,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"句","author":"陈旅","text":"能守不成三瓦戒。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":31977,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"悼亡","author":"傅若金","text":"惊飙吹罗幕，明月照阶戺。\n春草忽不芳，秋兰亦同死。\n斯人蕴淑德，夙昔明诗礼。\n灵质奄独化，孤魂将安止。\n迢迢湘西山，湛湛江中水；水深有时极，山高有时已！\n忧思何能齐，日月从此始。\n皇天平四时，白日一何遽！\n勤俭毕婚嫁，新人忽复故。\n衾裳歛遗袭，棺椁无完具。\n送葬出北门，徘徊怛归路。\n玉颜不可恃，况乃纨与素！\n累累花下坟，郁郁茔西树。\n他人亮同此，胡为独哀慕。\n新婚誓偕老，恩义永且深。\n旦暮为夫妇，哀戚奄相寻。\n凉月烛西楼，悲风鸣北林。\n空帷奠巾栉，中房虚织纴。\n辞章馀婉娈，琴瑟有馀音。\n眷言瞻故物，恻怆内不任。\n岂无新人好？\n焉知谐我心！\n掩穴抚长暮，涕下沾衣襟。\n人生贵有别，室家各有宜。\n贫贱远结婚，中心两不移。\n前日良宴会，今为死别离。\n亲戚各在前，临诀不成辞。\n傍人拭我泪，令我要裁悲。\n共尽固同理，谁能心勿思！","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":31978,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"句","author":"傅若金","text":"国蟠蜗角小，地接犬牙深。\n雨暗蛟龙出，天晴鹳鹤回。\n江路篁犹箨，山田稻始苗。\n黄归幽径犊，青聚古祠鸦。\n洒竹鸣宫女，持弓泣野臣。\n雨蒸归日路，云合去时山。\n衡庐树入青天尽，章贡波翻白日来。\n中天日月回金阙，南极星辰绕玉衡。\n交龙拥日明丹扆，飞凤随云绕画车。\n载笔旧登天禄阁，将书还到大明宫。\n百粤云山连楚大，六朝烟树入隋荒。\n焚香凤阁春开宴，鸣玉龙池午散朝。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":31979,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"留别","author":"黄裳","text":"江岸梅花正白，船头细雨斜飞。\n行客三冬北去，将军一棹南归。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":31980,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"句","author":"宋褧","text":"行人不敢来饮马，稚子时能坐钓鱼。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":31981,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"七夕寄宋显夫","author":"张仲容","text":"云压高城雨散丝，万家秋气入罗帷。\n巧棚七夕喧邻里，小宋明朝定有诗。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":31982,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"寄内","author":"吕思诚","text":"自从马上苦思卿，一个穷家两手擎。\n少米无柴休懊恼，大男小女好看成。\n恩深夫妇情何极，道合君臣义更明。\n早晚太平遂归计，连杯共饮话离情。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":31983,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"戏作","author":"吕思诚","text":"典却春衫办早厨，老妻何必更踌躇？\n瓶中有醋堪烧菜，囊里无钱莫买鱼。\n不敢妄为些小事，只因曾读数行书。\n严霜烈日皆经过，次第春风到草庐。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":31984,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"伍王庙","author":"廖毅","text":"浩浩凌云志，巍巍报国心。\n忠魂与潮汐，万古不消沈！","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":31985,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"感事","author":"李黼","text":"弥勒何神孕祸胎，?鼯动地起风埃。\n烟销郡国民生苦，血染江淮鬼物哀。\n人世百年遭此厄，天戈万里几时来。\n石田也有蓝田玉，可惜同成一炬灰。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":31986,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"虾助诗","author":"萨都剌","text":"层涛濡沬缀虾行，水母含秋孕地灵。\n海气冻成红玉脆，天风寒结紫云腥。\n霞衣褪色脂流滑，琼缕烹香酒力醒。\n疑是楚江萍实老，误随潮汐落沧溟。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":31987,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"句","author":"胡善","text":"领檄来司教，临危要致身。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":31988,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"大有年","author":"朱仲明","text":"五谷皆登几载无，今秋端不负菑畬。\n已欣亿秭仓箱积，肯数寻常儋石储。\n卦象曾占天上火，牧人应协梦中鱼。\n麟经二百馀年久，似此丰穰仅一书。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":31989,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"大有年","author":"杨得禄","text":"乃梦维鱼卜岁登，东皋南亩力深耕。\n一犁春雨欣沾足，百谷秋风喜用成。\n作息不知蒙帝力，讴歌聊以乐吾生。\n重书大有光千古，鼓腹含哺乐太平。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":31990,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"大有年","author":"汪志坚","text":"五十年无赤白囊，民安田井乐耕桑。\n鸡豚社雨家家酒，䆉稏外风处处香。\n已验天文占斗覆，剩收地利应金穰。\n王风喜值时雍盛，仰祝皇图日月长。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":31991,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"大有年","author":"胡元罙","text":"时和岁稔乐无边，大有堪书续鲁宣。\n居积囷禾皆万亿，伫看斗米只三钱。\n花村月照犬无吠，化国日长人醉眠。\n童叟相观皆额手，从兹深愿屡丰年。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":31992,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"句","author":"程维岩","text":"史笔特书当继鲁，诗声播颂载歌周。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":31993,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"句","author":"胡祥","text":"易地时沾沛然雨，平畴轻拂快哉风。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":31994,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"句","author":"柯九思","text":"夜雨推篷写松石，焚香何处独题诗。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":31995,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"句","author":"柯九思","text":"云飘五凤层楼矗，日绕群龙法驾来。\n鸳序久陪苍水使，凤池曾赋紫薇郎。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":31996,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题水村图","author":"哲理野台","text":"四野漫漫水接天，孤村林木似凝烟。\n莫言此地无车马，自是高人远市廛。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":31997,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"夜直","author":"焦文烱","text":"忆昨停骖便殿西，柳沟风软絮沾泥。\n一弯月子梨花上，冷浸香云伴鸟栖。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":31998,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"访周古象不遇留题","author":"斡玉伦都","text":"事亲未必可曾参，职分当为每愧心。\n今□风来飘忽动，抱琴更入白云深。","collection":"元","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":31999,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"上京纪行诗 其一 同吕仲实宿城外早行","author":"胡助","text":"我行得良友，夜宿建德门。\n晨征带残雨，华星缀云阴。\n局辔乘羸马，沿途共笑言。\n两京隔千里，气候殊寒暄。\n声利汩清思，山川发雄文。\n平生所未到，扈跸敢辞烦？\n愧予雁鹜姿，亦复陪鸾鹓。\n历历纪瑰伟，一见胜百闻。\n兹游偿夙愿，庶用归田园。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32000,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"上京纪行诗 其二 昌平","author":"胡助","text":"经过昌平县，实惟刘子乡。\n当时直言策，至今有耿光。\n功名真琐琐，气节横八荒。\n斯人宁复见，阅世徒慨慷。\n奉祠表谏议，化俗崇贤良。\n贼臣偶同里，遗臭亦难忘。\n严程惧稽缓，古迹嗟莫详。\n挥鞭事前迈，居庸翠苍苍。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32001,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"上京纪行诗 其三 居庸关","author":"胡助","text":"居庸古关塞，老我今见之。\n天险限南北，乱石如城陴。\n朝光映苍翠，征袖凉飔飔。\n涧谷四十里，崖峦争献奇。\n禽鸟鸣相和，草木蔚华滋。\n佛炉架岩上，疏泉汇清池。\n民居亦棋布，机硙临山陲。\n清幽入行李，缓策遂忘疲。\n黄屋年年度，深仁育黔黎。\n从官多名儒，山石遍题诗。\n伊余备史属，斐然愧文辞。\n矧兹中兴运，歌诵职所宜。\n皇灵符厚德，岂曰恃险巇。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32002,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"上京纪行诗 其四 怀来道中","author":"胡助","text":"百千僦一马，日行百馀里。\n未明即戒途，将至辄中止。\n人困马思睡，马疲徒用箠。\n驱驰失情性，老病侵发齿。\n可怜翰鞅掌，岂知固如是。\n径行古关塞，形胜那尽纪。\n荒落久宁静，富庶或成市。\n清晨过怀来，沙草风烟美。\n想当用武时，满野控弓矢。\n白塔远招人，挥鞭渡流水。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32003,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"上京纪行诗 其五 李老谷","author":"胡助","text":"人言桑乾北，六月少炎热。\n我行李老谷，流汗还病暍。\n疲马鞭不进，况复碍车辙。\n翠岩石幽幽，久晴涧泉竭。\n牛羊放山椒，穹庐补林缺。\n投宿山店小，子规啼夜血。\n南归空有怀，闻之愧刚决。\n顾方上滦阳，玉堂看秋月。\n更阑不成寐，声声山竹裂。\n期是明年春，相闻在吴越。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32004,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"上京纪行诗 其六 赤城","author":"胡助","text":"山石似丹垩，赤城因得名。\n土异产灵瑞，永宜奉天明。\n市廛集商贾，有驿通上京。\n触热此经过，忽看风雨生。\n平原走潢潦，河流浩新声。\n斯须即开霁，灿烂云霞横。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32005,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"上京纪行诗 其七 鳌峰","author":"胡助","text":"乾坤气磅礴，山石钟奇形。\n鳌峰才数尺，濯秀何亭亭！\n势欲负厚地，岌若霄汉淩。\n一峰更旁耸，玲珑穴虚明。\n青肤萦白障，微扣宣金声。\n中涵太湖润，瑰伟专上京。\n想当初凿时，山鬼泣以惊。\n置之玉堂前，几阅瀛洲登。\n年来对阁老，岷峨眼中青。\n雨渍生古色，月寒见霜棱。\n摩挲助文思，一挥九制成。\n谅勿忧豪夺，长兹托佳名。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32006,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"上京纪行见玉泉山下荷花","author":"胡助","text":"西山咫尺玉泉清，无数藕花香气生。\n立马岸边看不足，却疑五月过临平。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32007,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"榆林","author":"胡助","text":"倦客出关仍畏暑，居庸回首暮云深。\n青山环合势雄抱，不见旧时榆树林。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32008,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"枪竿岭二首 其一","author":"胡助","text":"九折盘纡过客愁，适当载笔扈宸游。\n长年见说枪竿岭，今日身亲到上头。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32009,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"枪竿岭二首 其二","author":"胡助","text":"下马徐徐陟涧冈，山风微动十分凉。\n桑乾岭上一回首，何处云飞是故乡？","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32010,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"再赋李老谷","author":"胡助","text":"李老谷中闻杜鹃，江南游子不归田。\n利名引得滔滔去，竟渡滦河朝日边。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32011,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"过桓州","author":"胡助","text":"阴云惨淡满天秋，马上龙钟拥毳裘。\n渐近滦京凉又别，斜风细雨过桓州。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32012,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题望都铺","author":"胡助","text":"坡陀散漫草茸茸，地接乌桓古塞风。\n仰止神京三十里，楼台缥缈碧云中。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32013,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"偶题","author":"胡助","text":"头上阴云如泼墨，阶前白雨似跳珠。\n秋来日日风雷作，并入滦阳八景图。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32014,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"宿牛群头","author":"胡助","text":"荞麦花开草木枯，沙头雨过茁蘑菇。\n牧童拾得满筐子，卖与行人供晚厨。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32015,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"御花园","author":"胡助","text":"朱扉金锁绿如云，雨露恩光草木新。\n若识九重临幸意，花时人世一般春。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32016,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"隐趣园八咏 其一 君子池","author":"胡助","text":"池上藕花开，香从太极来。\n亭亭清净观，君子日徘徊。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32017,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"隐趣园八咏 其二 待月坛","author":"胡助","text":"天远云归早，山高月上迟。\n夜坐发孤咏，秋风生桂枝。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32018,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"隐趣园八咏 其三 蜀锦屏","author":"胡助","text":"濯锦为屏障，红妆拥万妃。\n试看春睡足，何羡买臣归？","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32019,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"隐趣园八咏 其四 天香台","author":"胡助","text":"三月韶华盛，名花倾国人。\n何期真率会，同赏洛阳春。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32020,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"隐趣园八咏 其五 香雪壁","author":"胡助","text":"酴醾春意好，百尺走条枚。\n壁立堆香雪，风流入酒杯。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32021,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"隐趣园八咏 其六 晚香径","author":"胡助","text":"彭泽归来后，东篱菊正黄。\n秋光无限兴，晚节有馀香。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32022,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"隐趣园八咏 其七 竹涧亭","author":"胡助","text":"竹绕茅亭外，泉流石涧中。\n一天秋月夜，千载隐君风。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32023,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"隐趣园八咏 其八 岁寒亭","author":"胡助","text":"松竹如佳士，梅花更典刑。\n岁寒千古意，笑指鹿峰青。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32024,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"寿松记碑本","author":"杨瑀","text":"举世纷纷名利间，达生轻禄古今难。\n天生瑞兆为君寿，寄我山中作画看。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32025,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"静安八咏录二 其一 陈桧","author":"杨瑀","text":"殿前双桧郁龙蛇，翠雨溟濛锁绿霞。\n不逐后庭花片落，托根却在梵王家。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32026,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"静安八咏录二 其二 芦子渡","author":"杨瑀","text":"路入西风十里秋，月明飞雪下汀洲。\n关山著处皆戎马，容得山人不系舟。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32027,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"句","author":"赫德尔","text":"水溯颠崖流自转，山移绝塞势尤雄。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32028,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"春草","author":"何正","text":"春来无处不芳菲，色透湘帘好染衣。\n南浦暝烟凫鸟没，曲江寒雨鹧鸪飞。\n高人有意怜新绿，游子无心恋旧归。\n淮海年年空入望，六朝王业竟成非！","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32029,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"月","author":"何正","text":"宴罢瑶台出禁迟，玉轮飞上已多时。\n一天星斗光芒后，万里银河影渐移。\n素女夜寒初倦舞，嫦娥秋老正含悲。\n黄沙碛里凉如水，人在青楼有所思。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32030,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"句","author":"黄镇成","text":"王孙不归怨芳草，山鬼欲啼牵女萝。\n铁檄召雷秋雨足，瑶坛谒帝夜云高。\n游山采药辞家早，扫石看云出洞迟。\n青山尽处海门阔，红日上来天宇低。\n花竹一家巢绝顶，烟尘九点认齐州。\n潮来估客船归市，月上人家水浸空。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32031,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"句","author":"陈楚春","text":"红日马头天已近，青云雁背雨初晴。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32032,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"八月十五夜处州分司对月","author":"余阙","text":"玄武夕始正，华月升秋旻。\n徘徊出西陆，照曜此瓯闽。\n金波何穆穆，绿枝满中轮。\n馀辉动轩房，紫兰含微津。\n皇天降丰岁，王政亦已陈。\n乐哉一杯酒，允矣同庶人。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32033,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"句","author":"余阙","text":"野人篱落通潜口，贾客帆樯出汉阳。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32034,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"句","author":"王礼","text":"当户雨苔双石峻，隔江烟树数峰间。\n杖黎麦垄秋霜后，樽酒茅堂夕照閒。\n闻有古书人不见，柴门客去又常关。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32035,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"西湖竹枝词","author":"宇文公谅","text":"苏小门前骑马过，相逢白发老宫娥。\n自言记得前朝事，只说当年贾八哥。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32036,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"句","author":"蔡廷秀","text":"旌旗小小将军队，行李萧萧郎罢船。\n一水白随鸥鹭去，万山青逐虎龙眠。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32037,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"西湖竹枝词","author":"李介石","text":"春晖堂上挽郎衣，别郎问郎何处归？\n黄金台高倘回首，南高峰顶白云飞。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32038,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"观潮题樟亭","author":"樊执敬","text":"烟波闪闪海门开，平地潜生万壑雷。\n大信不亏天不老，浙江亭上看潮来。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32039,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"妙成观掀篷和何宗姚韵","author":"石抹宜孙","text":"结搆新亭似胜前，登临历历瞰晴川。\n放怀喜解防秋戍，乘兴还操下濑船。\n从此入林堪避地，何妨坐井亦观天。\n东风回首春城暮，桃李依然种日边。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32040,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"句","author":"黄复圭","text":"隐士高閒卧云处，故家轩豁读书斋。\n冉冉霜颠倚门处，飘飘风袂及家时。\n菡萏泉香金错落，苾刍风煖翠婆娑。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32041,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"挽樊时中参政","author":"鲁至道","text":"主将无谋怫众情，贤参有志惜言轻。\n狐群冲突成妖孽，黔首惊惶望太平。\n奋志从军全节义，杀身殉国显忠诚。\n岁寒桥下清泠水，夜夜空闻哽咽声。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":32042,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}}]